    <string name="companion_onboarding_step1_body">They listen when you record, keep you posted while your note is written, and cheer when it\'s ready. Never inside your notes.</string>
    <string name="companion_onboarding_step1_footnote">You can change this any time in Settings, or just long-press your companion.</string>
